ree\" href=\"http://www.openstreetmap.org/index.html\">http://www.openstreetmap.org/index.html</a>) Inhoud is beschikbaar onder de Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 license.</li>\n<li>Referentie-ondergrond op water bewerkt vanuit <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://satfoto.geoserve.nl/false-nl/index.html\">http://satfoto.geoserve.nl/false-nl/index.html</a>. Gebruik is vrij met bronvermelding NLR en ESA.</li>\n<li>Vectorgrenzen van gemeenten en regio's vrij ter beschikking gesteld met dank aan cartografen van brandweerregio's Hollands-Midden en IJsselland; gerasterd in Photoshop.</li>\n<li>Hoogte-aanduidingen (reliëf) gerasterd uit de AHN Viewer (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.ahn.nl/kaart/\">http://www.ahn.nl/kaart/</a>); gebruik is vrij met bronvermelding (c) AHN, www.ahn.nl;</li>\n<li>Overige kenmerken op de kaart: eigen tekenwerk van Jan-Willem van Aalst, op basis van gerasterde gemeentegrenzen.</li></ul>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2010-01-15", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Janwillemvanaalst\" title=\"User:Janwillemvanaalst\">Janwillemvanaalst</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "CC BY-SA 3.0", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "true", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "License": {"value": "cc-by-sa-3.0", "source": "commons-templates", "hidden